<title>NETHERLANDS: Ostend airport sees growth in May air cargo traffic.</title>
<headline>Ostend airport sees growth in May air cargo traffic.</headline>
<dateline>OSTEND 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend Airport has seen a considerable growth in air cargo traffic for the month of May, compared to May spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Ostend has gained some extra traffic from Maastricht airport in the Netherlands which adopted a policy of discouraging Illuyshin 76 aircraft last year because of noise concerns and Schiphol Amsterdam Airport is also carrying out similar policy to deter Chapter 2 aircraft, industry sources said.</p>
<p>In the month May 1997 figures showed:</p>
<p>					 May 97    May 96</p>
<p>    Airfreight volumes(tonnes) 9,366     7,642</p>
<p>    Passenger traffic	   11,640     8,889</p>
<p>    Movements			4,402     3,534</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
